sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as User / Browser
    participant API as FastAPI /auth/login
    participant Hasher as Argon2id Hasher
    participant JWT as PyJWT Token Engine
    participant Guard as RBAC Authorization Guard
    participant Res as Protected Resource

    Client->>API: POST /api/auth/login {email, password}
    API->>API: Query User by Email
    API->>Hasher: Verify password against password_hash
    alt Invalid Password
        Hasher-->>API: Password Mismatch
        API-->>Client: HTTP 401 Unauthorized
    else Valid Credentials
        Hasher-->>API: Password OK
        API->>JWT: Generate Access Token (sub, role, exp=120m)
        JWT-->>API: Signed JWT Token (HS256)
        API-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK {accessToken, user}
    end

    Note over Client,Res: Subsequent Authenticated Requests
    Client->>Guard: GET /api/admin/audit (Header: Bearer JWT)
    Guard->>JWT: Verify Signature & Expiration
    Guard->>Guard: Check User Role == 'admin'
    alt Insufficient Privileges
        Guard-->>Client: HTTP 403 Forbidden
    else Authorized
        Guard->>Res: Forward Request
        Res-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK (Audit Log Records)
    end
